00:00:07.679 --> 00:00:11.439
<v SPEAKER_02>This means that renewable energy companies are transforming themselves.

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:15.759
<v SPEAKER_02>They're like changing their core businesses to also become tech companies.

00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:23.760
<v SPEAKER_02>To me, this was like very mind blowing at first because this means you're at the same time the energy provider and the consumer.

00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:53.200
<v SPEAKER_00>As you probably know by now, my new book, Hyperscale, comes out in less than two weeks.

00:00:53.359 --> 00:01:01.920
<v SPEAKER_00>This is a book about the build-out of data centers and the backlash to it that we have really seen accelerate in the past six to twelve months.

00:01:02.159 --> 00:01:07.920
